===================
Type Checker README
===================

To build:

  $ make install && make

The type checker is part of the compilation process, so to type check a file,
you can run:

  $ node build/phase1/main-wrapper.js -type-check --run path/to/file.arr

Note that the --run flag is necessary for now, so as to use the new module system.

Table type checking (Table<{...}>, Row, Col; TypeScript compiler only) is
documented in TYPED-TABLES.md; run its suite with `make ts-tables-test`.
